            <ArticleTitle>The role of the pain psychologist, trigger point injections, reflex sympathetic dystrophy.</ArticleTitle>
            <Pagination>
                <MedlinePgn>93-7</MedlinePgn>
            </Pagination>
            <Abstract>
                <AbstractText>This feature presents information for patients in a question and answer format. It is written to simulate actual questions that many pain patients ask and to provide answers in a context and language that most pain patients will comprehend. Issues addressed in this issue are the role of the pain psychologist, trigger point injections, and reflex sympathetic dystrophy.</AbstractText>
            </Abstract>
